---
import MainGridLayout from "../layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";
---

<MainGridLayout
  title="西灵号"
  description="Max Lu's Digital Space"
>

  <!-- 首页介绍 -->

  <div class="card-base p-8 mb-8">

    <div class="leading-8 opacity-80">

      <p>
        「西灵号」取自阿瑟·克拉克的科幻小说《月海沉船》。
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4">
        它因人类的高傲显得不可一世，在宇宙面前不堪一击，却使得人类幸存。
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4">
        愿你也能拥有一艘「西灵号」。
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>



  <!-- Works -->

  <section class="mb-10">

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">
      Works
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

      <div class="card-base p-6">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg">
          💊 Flash Thoughts
        </h3>

        <p class="opacity-70 mt-2">
          Quick thoughts and notes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-base p-6">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg">
          📸 Moments
        </h3>

        <p class="opacity-70 mt-2">
          Photos and snapshots.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-base p-6">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg">
          📝 Blog
        </h3>

        <p class="opacity-70 mt-2">
          Long-form writing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-base p-6">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg">
          ➕ More
        </h3>

        <p class="opacity-70 mt-2">
          More explorations.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>



  <!-- Journey -->

  <section>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">
      Journey
    </h2>

    <div class="card-base p-6">

      <p>
        Places I've been and journeys I've taken.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--primary)]">
        Open Travel Map →
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>

</MainGridLayout>
